Error [E0041]: `Semaphore` is not in Jet; use a bounded channel as a token pool
  --> tests/ui/semaphore_teaching.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     Semaphore(4)
    |     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: each received token admits one worker until that worker sends the token back
 Fix: create `tasks.channel<Int>(capacity: N)`, seed N tokens, receive one before work, and send it back afterward

